.TH KINTSUGI-PACK 1 "2026-10-22" "kintsugi 0.8.0" "Kintsugi Manual"
.SH NAME
kintsugi-pack \- persona pack management
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kintsugi pack
list
.br
.B kintsugi pack
show <persona>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the persona pack. Personas define the agent's behavior and personality.
.SH COMMANDS
.IP \fBlist\fR
Show personas and their match rules
.IP \fBshow\fR
View a persona's full definition
.SH EXAMPLES
List personas:
.PP
  $ kintsugi pack list
.PP
View a persona:
.PP
  $ kintsugi pack show coder
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR kintsugi (1),
.BR kintsugi-persona (1)
